  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transparency International (Georgia, Moldova): &quot;Enhancing a Corruption Resilient Governance System in Georgia and Moldova&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching goal of this project is to enhance Georgia and Moldova&apos;s resilience against corruption, strengthen democracy, promote separation of powers and good governance throughout the countries by empowering civil society, youth and media to act as change agents, promoting European integration, and advocating for crucial reforms, with a special emphasis on the local government level.</narrative>
  </description>
